        "text_xyYB4n": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Cake Jars Shipped Nationwide From Charlotte's Sunflour</h2>\n<p>Our cake jars are individual-sized desserts built the same way we build everything at Sunflour: from scratch, in small batches, with real ingredients and no shortcuts. Moist cake, hand-crumbled and layered with house-made buttercream, sealed in a glass jar and ready to ship anywhere in the country.</p>\n<p>Six flavors to choose from: Birthday Cake, Cookies and Cream, Red Velvet, Midnight Chocolate, Lemon Drop, and Salted Caramel. Vegan and gluten-free versions are available in select flavors for anyone who needs them.</p>\n<h3>Built for Gifting and Shipping</h3>\n<p>Cake jars were designed to travel. They arrive sealed, in gift-ready packaging that needs no extra wrapping on your end. Recipients open the jar and enjoy. No cutting, no plating, no mess.</p>\n<p>They are one of our most-sent gifts for birthdays, anniversaries, get-wells, and just-because moments. If you are celebrating someone too far away to drop off something in person, these are the answer. They also work beautifully as <a href=\"/collections/wedding-cake-jars\">wedding favors and event desserts</a>, where individual portions are practical as well as personal.</p>\n<h3>Charlotte Pickup at Five Locations</h3>\n<p>If you are local, you can grab cake jars at any of our Charlotte shops: Elizabeth, Dilworth, Ballantyne, Harrisburg, and NoDa. Same from-scratch quality, no shipping wait. A good option when you want to grab something same-day or build your own assortment in person.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
