        "collapsible_row_GP998z": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long do your cake jars stay fresh?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Because we bake everything from scratch without artificial preservatives, enjoy your cake jars within seven to ten days of arrival when kept refrigerated. For the best texture, let the jar sit at room temperature for fifteen to thirty minutes before you eat. The buttercream softens and the cake loosens up in a way that makes a real difference. Worth the wait.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8Cipz7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you ship cake jars nationwide?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. We ship to all 50 states. Each cake jar is packaged carefully to arrive in the same condition it left our Charlotte kitchen. Whether you are ordering one jar or a dozen, we handle the shipping logistics so you can focus on the occasion.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gGmkdP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are cake jars good for corporate gifting or large events?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>They are one of our most popular corporate gift options and a strong choice for <a href=\"/collections/wedding-cake-jars\">weddings and events</a>. Individual portions mean no cutting or serving, and the glass jar presentation holds up well visually whether you are setting them at place settings or shipping them to individual addresses. Reach out if you are working on a large order so we can plan lead time together.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_aHHjbp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes Sunflour cake jars different from other cake-in-a-jar products?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>We bake the cake from scratch in small batches, crumble it by hand, and layer it with buttercream made in our Charlotte kitchens. No pre-made mixes, no tub frosting. The flavor difference between a from-scratch cake jar and a shortcut version is immediate once you taste them. That is the only thing that distinguishes ours.</p>",
            "page": ""
